WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.460
Oh, I imagine a dystopia.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.780
A dystopia where big rivers flow from the inland ice.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:17.740
Where the icebergs calve ice by the millions, by the tons, into the water.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:23.980
Where the entire ice landscape has turned completely dark because of the melt away.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:29.760
Where immense parts of the landscape is now soil and little trees start to grow.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:34.620
I imagine Northern Canada and the Northern Siberia where the permafrost melts

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:38.220
and the cities will fall into ruins because they were founded on a bog.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:43.060
Where tons of methane rises into the air which and increases the feedback processes

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.480
creating hellish machines of climate change which

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:53.320
again contributes to thawing even more permafrost and more methane will mix into the air.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.060
This is the future – It is not particularly pleasant.

